  "zh": "# 今日聚焦：AI压缩黎曼证明、机器人行业出清、中美关税与航天监管齐发\n## AI 与科技\n- **AI证明黎曼猜想代码大幅简化**：大模型将证明代码压缩99.5%，展示AI在严谨数学推理上的突破性进展。\n- **Google发布Cogentic整数分解与离散对数论文**：公开量子抗性算法新思路，可能重塑密码学基础设施。\n- **NFS2root Linux内核远程Root漏洞**：12年零日漏洞披露，警示基础设施补丁管理刻不容缓。\n## 行业动向\n- **机器人赛道两年近30家破产清算**：融资热度与商业化落地错位，行业进入残酷出清期。\n- **英伟达B300大量流入二手市场**：高端算力需求降温信号，供需关系或已发生结构性变化。\n## 国际视野\n- **外交部回应美拟对华等十几国加征关税**：贸易摩擦升级，供应链重构压力加大。\n- **美国两州起诉SpaceX**：监管与商业航天博弈白热化，可能重塑发射许可规则。",
  "en": "# Today's focus: AI compresses Riemann proof, robotics shakeout, US-China tariffs & space regulation flare\n## AI & Tech\n- **AI compresses Riemann proof code 99.5%**: Large models shrink formal proof to 7.6k lines, a breakthrough in rigorous mathematical reasoning.\n- **Google releases Cogentic papers on integer factorization and discrete logs**: Reveals quantum‑resistant algorithm ideas that could reshape cryptographic foundations.\n- **NFS2root Linux kernel remote root vulnerability**: A 12‑year pre‑auth zero‑day exposed, underscoring urgent patch management for critical infrastructure.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Robotics sector sees ~30 bankruptcies in two years**: Funding hype outpaces commercialization, forcing a brutal market consolidation.\n- **Nvidia B300 floods secondary market**: Signal of cooling high‑end compute demand, hinting at a structural shift in GPU supply‑demand.\n## Global Affairs\n- **China foreign ministry responds to US planned tariffs on a dozen nations**: Trade tensions rise, pressuring global supply‑chain restructuring.\n- **Two US states sue SpaceX**: Regulatory clash with commercial space intensifies, potentially reshaping launch licensing rules."
